    "title": "A95X W2 Android 11 Smart TV Box Amlogic S905W2 4GB 64GB Support 5G Wifi 4K 60fps VP9 BT5.0 Youtube Media Player",
    "body_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/IMG_2529.jpg?v=1643889071\" alt=\"A95x w2 android 11 smart tv box amlogic s905w2 4gb 64gb support 5g wifi 4k 60fps vp9 bt5.0 youtube media player\" loading=\"lazy\"></strong></span>\u00a0</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Android 11.0 TV Box ------A95X W2</strong></span></p>\n<h3><strong>Features:</strong></h3>\n<p>1.CPU: Amlogic S905W2 Quad Core ARM Cortex A35;</p>\n<p>2.GPU: ARM Mali-G31;</p>\n<p>3.OS: Android 11.0;</p>\n<p>4.Memory: DDR3 4GB, eMMC 64GB;</p>\n<p>5.Support: AV1, H.265, VP9+, HDR+,4K@60fps;</p>\n<p>6.Support: 100M LAN, 2.4&amp;5G Dual Wifi, BT5.0;</p>\n<p>7.Support: Wallpaper Changeable, Youtube HD 4K;</p>\n<p>8.Support Wireless Upgrade (OTA).</p>\n<h3>\u00a0<strong>Package Include:</strong>\n</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>1\u00a0x A95X W2 TV Box</li>\n<li>1\u00a0x Remote control</li>\n<li>1\u00a0x Power Supply</li>\n<li>1\u00a0x HD Cable</li>\n<li>1 x User Manual</li>\n<li><br></li>\n</ul>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/image_2022-01-05_154534.png?v=1641377739\" alt=\"A95x w2 android 11 smart tv box amlogic s905w2 4gb 64gb support 5g wifi 4k 60fps vp9 bt5.0 youtube media player\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"A95x w2 android 11 smart tv box amlogic s905w2 4gb 64gb support 5g wifi 4k 60fps vp9 bt5.0 youtube media player\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/image_2022-01-05_154547.png?v=1641377751\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"A95x w2 android 11 smart tv box amlogic s905w2 4gb 64gb support 5g wifi 4k 60fps vp9 bt5.0 youtube media player\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/image_2022-01-05_154559.png?v=1641377764\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"A95x w2 android 11 smart tv box amlogic s905w2 4gb 64gb support 5g wifi 4k 60fps vp9 bt5.0 youtube media player\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/image_2022-01-05_154612.png?v=1641377777\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"A95x w2 android 11 smart tv box amlogic s905w2 4gb 64gb support 5g wifi 4k 60fps vp9 bt5.0 youtube media player\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/image_2022-01-05_154624.png?v=1641377796\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"A95x w2 android 11 smart tv box amlogic s905w2 4gb 64gb support 5g wifi 4k 60fps vp9 bt5.0 youtube media player\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/image_2022-01-05_154646.png?v=1641377810\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"A95x w2 android 11 smart tv box amlogic s905w2 4gb 64gb support 5g wifi 4k 60fps vp9 bt5.0 youtube media player\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/image_2022-01-05_154658.png?v=1641377823\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"A95x w2 android 11 smart tv box amlogic s905w2 4gb 64gb support 5g wifi 4k 60fps vp9 bt5.0 youtube media player\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/image_2022-01-05_154710.png?v=1641377834\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"A95x w2 android 11 smart tv box amlogic s905w2 4gb 64gb support 5g wifi 4k 60fps vp9 bt5.0 youtube media player\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/image_2022-01-05_154724.png?v=1641377851\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img alt=\"A95x w2 android 11 smart tv box amlogic s905w2 4gb 64gb support 5g wifi 4k 60fps vp9 bt5.0 youtube media player\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/Capture_80154d6e-d94b-4b7d-848d-3ea912d23a65_480x480.png?v=1640243799\" loading=\"lazy\"></strong></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
